    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have inexplicable luck that seems to kick in at just the right moment.</p>\n<p>You have 3 Luck points per Long Rest. Whenever you make a d20 test (an attack roll, ability check, or saving throw), you can spend 1 Luck point to gain Advantage on the roll. Alternatively, when an attack roll is made against you, you can spend 1 Luck point to impose Disadvantage on that attack roll.</p>",
